{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_971.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"7e9f1677c8e9ce514af6d9b0c6fe3fefd9bbf1ceb1ad416df0c35522dac6ecbe","ja":"（「クリスマス会のみなさんの歌声、\nとても素晴らしかったですわ」）","zh":"（“圣诞会大家的歌声，真是美妙动听呢”）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_971.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"0f505be001712d94c7aa9a61339031ad56165ac8b4649758b695480869409ba5","ja":"（「今年もたくさん楽しいことが起こりますように」\n……ふふっ。喜んでくれるかしら♪）","zh":"（“希望今年也能发生许多开心的事情。”\n……呵呵，她会喜欢吗♪）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_971.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"196b0f953a40bc50a500c021a7207d8cc6d389aa5d57425ba44e7ef1369bf66f","ja":"（「ミキ、またデュオで思いっきり歌っちゃおうネ！」\nエヘヘ、シールもいっぱい付けちゃおうかナ♪）","zh":"（“美希，我们再一起尽情唱二重唱吧！\n嘿嘿，要不要也贴上好多贴纸呢♪”）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_971.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"c064e0b4e42728d5dff4392de00c4edb8b0aac84ab14a217c3ba5ddf9cda17f6","ja":"……なんだか不思議だネ。お礼の気持ちを込めてたら、\n書いてるワタシもすごく楽しくなっちゃうヨ♪","zh":"……感觉真奇妙呢。怀着感谢的心情写着写着，连我也变得特别开心了♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_971.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"d00eee3c2a895f834a6d4263b2673252b80b2b7a83ea2f3e50d58d1a2c511a55","ja":"ええ。年賀状は本当に素敵な文化だと思いますわ♪\nもっともっと書いていきますわよ♪","zh":"是的。我觉得贺年卡真的是一种非常美好的文化♪\n我还要继续写更多贺年卡哦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_971.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"4aebe9edc82438d71084e4bc80e0c2db7c792f743b32dda763c4eee8f1e8e3d3","ja":"それじゃあ、次は●●●●プロデューサーに……。","zh":"那么接下来，就轮到●●●●制作人……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
