{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_971.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"807c3e8a31c12ae2a03d386afb8b9d270dea4dc6f79d6cabdea5e9aac5fcdd7e","ja":"みなさん、そろそろ\n●●●●プロデューサーが来る時間です。","zh":"大家，差不多到●●●●制作人该来的时间了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_971.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"83ee2853a41da75b1a7959606335792dd6a218f3c3cafb78bfa1811f3d7467ba","ja":"えっ……ええ～っ！？\nもうそんな時間！？","zh":"诶……诶诶～！？\n已经这么晚了！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_971.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"d9bd2f49eefeb97ec92173364e52c23c553a9094f3679bddf6a89a100c0aab50","ja":"●●●●プロデューサー、今日は\nこの部屋使うんだったよね……はやく片付けないと！","zh":"●●●●制作人，今天要用这个房间来着吧……得赶紧收拾了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
