{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_971.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"526a4b843fe187785384a1fbd51d90851c30b7bd3ade9e22d5e8f93db6ab333c","ja":"うっ、ボクもそうなりそう……でもどうせなら\n元日あたりに届くようにしたいし……でも……あっ！","zh":"呜，我好像也会变成那样……不过既然如此，我还是想让它在元旦左右送到……可是……啊！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
